Kind: Structure
DungeonFurniture: Dungeon: furniture of its rooms
DungeonLights: Dungeon: chandeliers and lanterns
DungeonBanners: Dungeon: banners on its walls
DungeonPaintings: Dungeon: paintings on its walls
DungeonTraps: Dungeon: traps
DungeonChest: Dungeon: {0}
UnderworldHouses: Underworld houses
UnderworldChest: Underworld: {0}
DungeonBody: Placed in the Dungeon when the world is made; break it to take it. Until {0} is defeated, the {1} kills anyone who goes in
TempleBody: Placed in the Jungle Temple when the world is made; break it to take it. The temple's door opens with the {0}, which {1} drops
UnderworldBody: Placed in the ruined houses of the Underworld when the world is made; break it to take it
BiomeChestBody: One such chest per world, locked since the world was made: a {0} opens it, and only once {1} is defeated
LockedChestBody: Placed locked when the world is made: open it with a {0}, empty it and break it to take the chest
OneColor: Only in a dungeon of its color: each world builds its Dungeon blue, green or pink
ThreeKinds: Each world has only {0} of the {1} kinds
RandomPainting: Paintings are picked at random, so not every world has this one
CorruptionWorld: Only in a world with the Corruption
CrimsonWorld: Only in a world with the Crimson
